'''Miltank''' (Japanese: '''ミルタンク''' ''Miltank'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

